Z||000008||Stoic||12-11-2000||04:13 PM||||kinboy: I live towards Adelaide and Commissioners.  Right now, I'm unfortunately not driving anything.  My engine is passing on.  It still runs, but barely.  It is a 85 SE with a indy pacecar front clip and ground effects, painted black.  This was done before I bought it.  Also has american racing rims (5 stars), "fiero" banner across front windshield.  Right now she's sitting in crappy tire parking lot on Horton.  Still trying to figure out what to do.  I can't find any other half decent fieros around so I may have to buy something else as a temporary driver.||||reg||1
